##======================================================================
## PWA Asset Protection Rules
##======================================================================
# Ensure your active development service workers and web manifest are tracked
!wwwroot/service-worker.js
!wwwroot/service-worker.published.js
!wwwroot/manifest.webmanifest
!wwwroot/manifest.json

# CRITICAL EXCLUSION: Ignore local hot-reload / dynamic asset artifacts 
# which cause PWA hash integrity check failures during dev cycles.
wwwroot/service-worker-assets.js

